  <section class="hero-legal">
    <div class="conteneur">
      <h1>AZERTY Coach</h1>
      <p class="hero-legal__definition hero-legal__definition--etat">A free connector that lets Claude, ChatGPT or Codex tell you how to type a character on a French keyboard.</p>
      <p class="hero-legal__definition">It needs no account and no sign-in, and it only reads data: it changes nothing on your side.</p>
      <nav class="sommaire" aria-label="Sections of the page">
        <a class="sommaire__chip" href="#features">What it does</a>
